{"2218060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Backdraft","steam_appid":2218060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly difficult heroes who draft, summon, and play cards just like you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outbuild them, outplay them, and fight your way to victory!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft your deck one shop visit at a time. Open packs, upgrade cards, recruit minions, and uncover artifacts. Spend wisely. The fate of your run is built one choice at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win fights to earn blessings that improve future shops, turning each victory into better choices, bigger rewards, and new ways to shape your deck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a pairing: choose a hero, then choose a companion. Your hero has a unique power, and your companion unlocks your second elemental card pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pairing decides what kind of run you are building. Draft around your strengths, cover your weaknesses, and discover endless combinations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/ea33ede173b0c83f6885a7ae5293eccf.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on increasingly difficult heroes who draft, summon, and play cards just like you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outbuild them, outplay them, and fight your way to victory!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/c30f34fac24ed716259b454f135067df.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/855602c188e861ba9239ca2e623ecad3.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft your deck one shop visit at a time. Open packs, upgrade cards, recruit minions, and uncover artifacts. Spend wisely. The fate of your run is built one choice at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win fights to earn blessings that improve future shops, turning each victory into better choices, bigger rewards, and new ways to shape your deck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/1aa08361c2580129eaed6cef66e8bdcc.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.avif?t=1793735219\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras_big\/6ae3d561f1e8995b5e6ae81c97d2f043.webp?t=1793735219 width=1560 height=112 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a pairing: choose a hero, then choose a companion. Your hero has a unique power, and your companion unlocks your second elemental card pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pairing decides what kind of run you are building. Draft around your strengths, cover your weaknesses, and discover endless combinations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.poster.avif?t=1793735219\" width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.webm?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/extras\/d7673b827fc090cdb427d6ef63d67fdc.mp4?t=1793735219\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"The deckbuilding brawler. Backdraft is a hero vs hero roguelike battle for board control. Draft your deck, summon your minions, and unleash game-flipping combos. Conquer the six realms solo, or challenge your friends online.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/714cbcdf9d78286eb3b673345a135c3fecf6b9c2\/header.jpg?t=1793735219","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/515674cb88a7a4521e8944b8b6d95f8a425da839\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793735219","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2218060\/515674cb88a7a4521e8944b8b6d95f8a425da839\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793735219","website":"https:\/\/backdraft.gg\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1050 \/ AMD 500 Series or better<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-11400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5500 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 1050 \/ AMD 500 Series or better<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14 Sonoma or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 \/ Intel Core i5 (2018 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU \/ Intel UHD Graphics 630 or better<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 26 Tahoe or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro integrated GPU or better<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Legacy Labs"],"publishers":["Legacy Labs"],"demos":[{"appid":4623980,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currenc